From: mbt28 <btekbas@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: sunxi: add the suniv TV decoder (composite video capture)

V4L2 capture driver for the F1C100s/F1C200s TV decoder (TVD), the CVBS
input block at 0x01c0b000 with two inputs (TVIN0/TVIN1). The block is
undocumented: it is the A20 TVD decoder core behind a different register
layout, with one DMA channel. Register meanings come from bench
measurements on an F1C200s and from public reverse-engineering notes of the
vendor Melis SDK (register dumps while capturing, decompiled sys_tvd); the
standard tables are the vendor's values.

Measured on hardware and relied on here:
- frame-done IRQ (0x094/0x09c bit 24) once per FRAME (40 ms PAL);
- the DMA address is double-buffered: armed with 0x088 bit 28, latched at
  the frame boundary for the next frame, so the IRQ handler queues one
  frame ahead with a whole frame of slack;
- the hardware weaves both fields into one buffer (V4L2_FIELD_INTERLACED);
- the 3D comb filter keeps a 2 MiB field memory at 0x04c..0x050 and is
  switched as the vendor's BSP_TVD_3D_COMB_Filter() does: 0x048 armed
  (0x04040001, bits 26/18 self-clear), 0x008 bit 0 cleared (2D comb
  off) and 0x000 bit 4 set; only while streaming, when the memory exists;
- colour lock depends on the burst gate (0xf10 [23:16] end, [15:8]
  start, the V40 TVD_CLOCK1 fields): the vendor end value 0x8a never
  locked colour on a PAL bench camera, which locked for every end value
  from 0x46 to 0x7c, so the default is 0x60 and both are controls;
- 0x00c/0x010 match the V40 enhancement registers: contrast and
  saturation 0x80 = unity gain, so contrast defaults to 0x80 (the
  vendor's 0x68 is 0.8x), and the sharpen enable (0x00c bit 24, set at
  reset) is cleared as the vendor does;
- the DMA takes full physical addresses.

Formats NV12 and NV16 at 720x576 / 720x480. Inputs, standards (NTSC-M,
PAL, PAL-M, PAL-Nc, SECAM; the last three unverified), QUERYSTD and the
input lock status come from the decoder status register. Controls:
brightness, contrast, saturation, hue, sharpness, plus driver controls
for chroma gain (0xf1c [23:16]), chroma enhance (off/mild..high), the
burst gate start/end, blue screen (off/on/auto) and the 3D comb filter.
The decoder is powered only while the device is open; the comb filter
memory is allocated only while streaming.

v4l2-compliance 1.28.1 -s 30: 80 tests, 0 failures, 0 warnings.
